+
+| existing input | explicit owner and successor |
+|---|---|
+| `fn_in` | collection forcing inventory, one artifact per `run_id` |
+| `DATA_SOURCES` / `data_libs` | generation's source resolver materializes the consumed catalog entries in `preparation_catalog.yml`, with required URI targets copied into `ancillary/`; original catalogs are generation provenance only |
+| `clim_source` / `precip_source` | producer resolves physical preparation context once: generated-forcing reader metadata, PET method and forcing-elevation source; source label remains provenance, never a stage-2 branch selector |
+| CHIRPS `oro_path` | copy the existing source-grid sidecar byte-for-byte into the collection; preserve its grid, units, CRS, nodata and catalog driver metadata |
+| other catalog-selected forcing elevation / auxiliary reads | resolve and package every file actually required by the current preparation call with original catalog semantics; no fallback to a live catalog or remote source at consumption |
+| model root/static maps/state/TOML | WF1 model reference and existing model digest, owned by simulation |
+| `sim_start`, `sim_end`, correction settings | simulation settings projection; checked against collection forcing coverage |
+| per-run catalog, forcing and TOML output paths | simulation adapter outputs; paths do not supply physical metadata |
